. * Restarting an unconditional fit: nwsaom refit passes the coefficients (theta0)
. * and the rates (rate0)
. quietly nwsaom, waves(glasgow1 glasgow2 glasgow3) outdegree reciprocity gwesp(.69) unconditional seed(4)

. nwsaom refit, seed(5)

